<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">- Mbembe Osopong [MFNOs]</book>
  <para style="h">Rut</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rut</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nnwẹr s'Rut</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nnwẹr s'Rut</para>
  <para style="ip">Idik s'iyini sabẹ akkẹrẹ ma nnwẹr nna, iyini k'okpe kw'anạng p'Israẹl kk'anwa k'isek s'Kenaan, s'ide isek s'Ubinọkpaabyi ochekhi ọnạng anạng pẹ. Ma okpe ngwọ, asi-ẹyaakha p'Ubinọkpaabyi p'ade Mosẹs, ọttạra Joshua kk'apua; okpe tạm núkpira kw'Ubinọkpaabyi m'ọnạng anạng p'Israẹl avaarnạng. Ma okpe ngwọ ma, abẹ ayeri anạng p'adạbhẹ Israẹl “asi-aponga.” Wa, okpe ngwọ ode okpe kw'nkhọr, ọttạra kw'irem.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s">Ẹlimẹlẹk ọttạra ẹchọhmfhạr chẹ ata k'ẹkhạma ch'Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />K'okpe kw'uwa asi-aponga adạbhẹ Israẹl, wa okwo fididen uning ma isisek nnọ. Ujunung wạnọ kw'ubin Bẹtẹlẹhẹm k'ẹkhạma ch'Juda, ubin ọttạra ikwanạng kwẹ, ọttạra ajunungva pẹ afa, abẹ ata aruk k'isisek s'Moab. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Ujunung nwọ okpen Ẹlimẹlẹk, ikwa okpena Naomi, ajunungva pẹ afa akpena Malọn ọttạra Kiliyọn. Wa abẹma phyibh ade ammaana p'Ẹphrat p'arukhu k'ofhon kw'Bẹtẹlẹhẹm k'ẹkhạma ch'Juda. Wa abẹ abin ata aruk k'Moab.<verse eid="RUT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Ẹlimẹlẹk, kw'ode udim kw'Naomi ukwu ope, urik ẹma ọttạra ajunungva pẹ afa. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Ajunungva mbọ atạk ipanạng ma Moab. Ikwanạng wạnọ okpen Ọpa, nwọkha okpena Rut. Abẹ aruk maa, ukpira masẹ icho jobh <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />tạrr Malọn ọttạra Kiliyọn abạra ape, kw'usi Naomi dạkhẹ udim ọttạra iva kọ́khaam.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naomi ọttạra Rut akpa nnạm k'Bẹtẹlẹhẹm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Okpe kw'Naomi uning k'Moab ọbhaanga bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'ạnạng pẹ ọkkaana ọnạng bẹ uchiattọhk, Naomi ọttạra ipanạng p'iva pẹ ado ifor bẹ́, akpa nnạm abhạna. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Mạnna wọ kw'Naomi ubin ọttạra ipanạng p'iva pẹ afa, atạma osenga afona k'ẹkhạma ch'Juda.<verse eid="RUT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Masẹ abẹ n'afona ma o, Naomi n'obeni ipanạng p'iva pẹ bẹ́, “Ọnạng-ọnạng, sọhng abhạna k'akka k'ọchọhm. Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi bạnga ọphyaam, k'oche kw'abạnga kk'asia anạng apfuranạng pabạnga ọttạra amma. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạng, ọnạng-ọnạng ẹyọhng-kwokha k'ọchọhm kw'udim kwẹ ọbhakwẹ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 1:9">Mạnna wọ kw'Naomi oseng ọbaakha bẹ, abẹ agạma k'ẹrạng-k'ẹrạng, <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />abẹ aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Mma e, amạna m'antwạn abọ amkpa nnạm antọr anạng pọ.”<verse eid="RUT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Ma o, Naomi ọbẹ́, “Iva paam, akpa nnạm abhạna kabạnga k'ofhon! Mbạng vọ abạnga m'asenga apfẹ ator-m o? Ma abạnga akkẹ bẹ́, s'm'mmaan ajunungva dạkhẹ p'm'akwu ade adim pabạnga o? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Iva paam o, akpa nnạm abhạna e. Amma kk'nttạma nyọhnga idimba. Ọbạra mba udim ma irungu, mmaan ajunungva, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />abạnga s'm'aninga atik bẹ́, abẹ abạr o? Ma, abạnga bạra akpa abạngama oyeni idimba o? Mma e, iva paam. Akwẹ ọmma amma ọyọhnga abạnga ma e, ukwuru bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'nnạm ọkpa ọvạr-m!”<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Ma o, abẹ agạma adạkhẹ. Ọpa ọbaakha ọkka-ọmaan-udim kwẹ, ọkpa nnạm otor anạng pẹ. Okhenka, Rut ọkpạna bẹ́, ẹma m'ọtwạn Naomi abẹ.<verse eid="RUT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Ma wọ Naomi obeni Rut bẹ́, “Kkeri oche kw'oyok-ọfhạbha kk'nnạm ọkpa k'anạng pẹ ọttạra k'akha pẹ. Ọma tor-ẹ abạnga akpa nnạm.”<verse eid="RUT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Rut ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Kaam kákwa bẹ́, mkpa nnạm. Ibyi sidede s'afon, ẹrọ m'mfona. Ibyi sidede s'ayim, erọ m'nyima. Ubinọkpaabyi kw'akpobh, ẹwọ m'mbạra mkpobha. <verse eid="RUT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Ibyi s'apẹ, m'mpe ma, abẹ m'anọhng-m ma. Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọnạng-m irem, k'oche kw'ọdaakh-ẹ, óde nạn obo mạnkeni núdia m'ọbhaangẹ amma ọma abẹ.”<verse eid="RUT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Okpe kw'Naomi osong bẹ́, Rut kk'ifor udia bẹ́, ọtwạn abẹ, uttiẹ-ẹ ọbọhk. <verse eid="RUT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Ma o, abẹma ncho mfa asenga akpira k'Betẹlẹhẹm. Okpe kw'abẹ akpir k'Bẹtẹlẹhẹm, anạng p'ofhon ngwọ phyibh awur ẹmạng, ipanạng abạra abạbh bẹ́, “Naomi wọ ma yeri?”<verse eid="RUT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Naomi oben bẹ bẹ́, “Abạnga kaam Naomi káyeri, ayer-m Mara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mara </char><char style="ft" closed="false">uyini, ejobhu.</char></note>, ukwuru bẹ́, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa phyibh kk'akpen paam usia apyẹ ejobhu. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Mbin mama k'ọsaabh, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kk'aam utima ukwuna mbọhk-mbọhk. Abạnga m'asi yạn ayer-m, Naomi, s'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa phyibh kk'nnạm ọkpa ọvạr-m o?”<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Ma wọ Naomi utim Rut kw'ubin Moab, kw'ọbạra ode ikwanạng kw'nnwa kwẹ, ubina k'Moab ọkpa nnạm k'Bẹtẹlẹhẹm k'okpe kw'iphya s'ọrasẹ-khira kw'okpen, <char style="it">barli</char>.<figure style="fig" alt="Two people harvesting" file="lb00098c.tif" size="col" loc="1.22" ref="1.22">Abẹ asi iphya</figure><verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Rut okkebh Boaz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Wa Naomi ọkhaam uchimma-nạng wạnọ kw'udim kwẹ kw'okpen Boaz, kw'ubin k'efonamma ch'Ẹlimẹlẹk. Boaz nwọ wa ode ọnạng kw'uyini eche.<verse eid="RUT 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Wa Rut kw'ubin Moab obeni Naomi bẹ́, “Tte mfona k'iwonu, ọfha ntor anạng nnạm nta mpra arasẹ-khira p'akpen, barli, p'n'atto, ode s'm'nse ọnạng kw'm'usim-m ọphyaam o.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:2">Naomi ubhin-ẹ bẹ́, “Nnwa kwaam, sọhng ata asi oche kw'abeni.” <verse eid="RUT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Ma wọ Rut ubin ofona k'owonu, ọtạma abarli-mạma pạpra otor anạng p'nasi iphya nnạm. K'oche kw'idik n'ide, Rut wa otera ọta usi ọtọhm k'owonu kw'Boaz kw'ubin k'efonamma ch'Ẹlimẹlẹk.<figure style="fig" alt="Heads of barley" file="lb00102c.tif" size="col" loc="2.3" ref="2.3">Ọrasẹ-khira kw'okpen, barli</figure><verse eid="RUT 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Okpe núbhira, Boaz ubina k'Bẹtẹlẹhẹm ukwu ukpira, usima atọhmnạng mbọ bẹ́, “Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi odo bạnga!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:4">Abẹ achera bẹ́, “Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi udiọ-ọ!”<verse eid="RUT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Boaz ọbạbh okkeri-atọhmnạng pẹ bẹ́, “Uminanwa kwanẹ wọ khạkha?”<verse eid="RUT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Okkeri-atọhmnạng ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Ẹma ode uminanwa kw'ubin Moab, kw'ọtwạnọ Naomi abẹ k'Moab ukwuna ma. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Ophyem-m bẹ́, nttie-ẹ ọbọhk otor atọhmnạng mba nnạm ọpra abarli-mạma. S'obobe ọtạma ọtọhm k'ekpebha tạrr ukpira mantọhmma, okhenka okwokha ọyọhng k'okpe nwa sạsạkhẹ k'offo.”<figure style="fig" alt="Grain sheaves" file="hk00100c.tif" size="col" loc="2.7" ref="2.7" /><verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Ma wọ Boaz obeni Rut bẹ́, “Nnwa kwaam, khọhm-m itọhng. Nạngẹ k'owonu ọdwạkh-ọdwạk afon ata asi ọtọhm o, owonu ngwa ọbọhk kábạra atte o. Ninga ma ọttạra atọhmnạng paam p'ipanạng. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Kkeri owonu kw'atọhmnạng n'asi iphya, ator atọhmnạng p'ipanạng nnạm. Kk'ajunung mbọ itọhng ntwạra bẹ́, abẹ nạng-ọ ipyibha asi. De asi adaakh-ọ, sọhng ata agwo k'nsi-jọ s'ajunung mbọ kk'asi atọhra age.”<verse eid="RUT 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Ma o, Rut ọrạkha uttima ititikha k'isisek, oben bẹ́, “Amma nde ukhikhennạng, oseng yạn kw'asi ọphyaam-dema mva anạng-m o?”<verse eid="RUT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Boaz ọpọhna bẹ́, “Abẹ kk'aam ijibha chidede ch'kk'asia anạng ọkka-ọmaan-udim kwọ akpaakha e. Tạma s'udim obobe ope, abin arik atte ọttạra akka, ottra anạng pọ, ọttạra ofhon kwọ, akwu aruk anạng p'nạnásong abẹ. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi kw'anạng p'Israẹl, kw'kk'arạbha akwu ajena udiọ-ọ mororo.”<verse eid="RUT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Rut ọbẹ́, “Aro kwaam, tte ọphyaam f'nkhaam kakhọ ititikha ofona ororo ode pfaam. Kk'aam nttem afokha, abạra akpaakh-m itọhnga s'inạng-m ottembạr, oseng s'nạn mbenga k'ininga ch'atọhmnạng pọ p'ipanạng.”<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />K'okpe kw'uchiattọhk chichi, Boaz oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Kwuna njakha. Mekhi brẹd bọhnga k'atwuk p'vinegar chi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:14">Masẹ Rut kk'ẹyạr uninga ọttạra atọhmnạng abẹ, Boaz ọnạng-ẹ agwu abhaabhapẹ, uchi ọdọhbh, apyẹ ẹbhạkhẹ ebek. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Okpe kw'ubin bẹ́, ọta usi ọtọhm, Boaz oben atọhmnạng pẹ bẹ́, “S'ọbạra udwung ukpira k'akhe, abạnga kẹ kásẹkhẹ. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Abạnga atera arengi acho bạnọ k'akhe anạng-ẹ, attiẹ-ẹ ọbọhk udwunga, abạnga kẹ káttạbhẹ.”<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Rut usi ọtọhm ma owonu ngwọ tạrr iwu ẹsa. Ọkhaan abarli-mạma p'kk'udwunga tạrr apyẹ n'irikhi sạsạkhẹ ifu ikhạrạbaang sididen. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Udira abarli-mạma mbọ ọkpa nnạm k'ọchọhm, ọta ọkhọhkha ọkka-ọmaan-udim. Rut ọbạra ọnạng-ẹ uchiattọhk f'wạra uchi urik s'kk'ọdọhbha.<verse eid="RUT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Ọkka-ọmaan-udim ọbọbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Bạng ibyi rọ s'ayini chemma o? Asi ọtọhm mạn? Tte idia ede ch'ọnạng nwọ kw'ugiọ-ọ utum!” Ma wọ Rut ọkpaakhẹ ọkka-ọmaan-udim idik otena k'ujunung kw'usi ọtọhm kakhẹ k'ibyi, ọbẹ́, “Ujunung kw'nsi abẹ ọtọhm chemma, okpen Boaz.”<verse eid="RUT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Ma wọ Naomi obeni Rut bẹ́, “Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi odo Boaz k'idik-jibh chẹ otena anạng p'atim arukhu akpen, ọttạra p'kk'apua. Ujunung nwọ ode uchinạng kwamạna, ọbạra ode ọkkaan-ichimma kwamạna.”<verse eid="RUT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Ma wọ Rut kw'ubin Moab obeni bẹ́, “Ujunung nwọ oter oben-m bẹ́ nninga atọhmnạng pẹ abẹ tạrr iphya isa.”<verse eid="RUT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Naomi oben Rut bẹ́, “Nnwa kwaam, ọbaan-ọbaana bẹ́ asi ọtọhm ọttạra atọhmnạng pẹ p'ipanạng, deja, de afon k'owonu kw'ọnạng ọdwạkh-ọdwạk, abẹ akke ma anạng-ọ ẹsẹkha.”<verse eid="RUT 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Ma wọ Rut uning ọgbaara atọhmnạng p'Boaz p'ipanạng, usi ọtọhm ttạrr iphya s'abarli ọttạra s'awit isa. Ma okpe ngwọ phyibh, wa Rut urukhu ọkka-ọmaan-udim abẹ.<figure style="fig" alt="Heads of wheat" file="hk00099c.tif" size="col" loc="2.23" ref="2.23">Ọrasẹ-khira kw'okpen, wit</figure><verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s">Naomi usi nttọhna s'ọbada kw'Rut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Iwu jạnẹ, Naomi kw'ode ọkka-ọmaan-udim kw'Rut, obeni Rut bẹ́, “Nnwa kwaam, ọbaan bẹ́ nnor udim nnạng-ọ kw'm'okker-ọ. <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Boaz nwọ kw'n'asi ọtọhm ọttạra atọhmnạng pẹ p'ipanạng, ode uchinạng kwamạna. Songa bẹ́ ma irungu, m'ọkhaan abarli-mạma k'ibyi sabẹ n'aninga aguma abarli-mạma. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Sọhng ata akpobha asi, afọhnọ ana p'arebhi iruk, age ẹnya ch'ede ọkkachẹ, brasẹ n'afon k'ibyi sabẹ n'aninga aguma abarli-mạma. Kàsi osonga bẹ́, aning mạma, ttạrr uchi ọttọhk phyibh, ogwo atwuk. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />M'age utum k'ibyi s'm'uyima. De kk'uyima, sọhng ata awong-ẹ ivạra, ayim-ẹ ma mfhokpatwạkhọ. M'otekh-ọ oche kw'masi.”<figure style="fig" alt="Winnowing grain" file="hk00097c.tif" size="col" loc="3.4" ref="3.4">Abẹ akhaanẹ abarli-mạma</figure><verse eid="RUT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Rut ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Amma m'nsi oche kwidede kw'abeni bẹ́, nsi.” <verse eid="RUT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Mạnna wọ Rut ubin ofona k'ibyi sabẹ n'aninga aguma abarli-mạma, ọta usi oche kw'ọkka-ọmaan-udim oben-ẹ bẹ́, usi. <verse eid="RUT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Okpe kw'Boaz kk'ọttọhk uchia phyibh, ọbạra ogwo atwuk, ettem erebh-ẹ, ọta uyima k'ukwung kw'abarli-mạma, ọttaabha. Rut ọbẹkh-ọbẹk ọta owonga ivạra s'ibubh mfhokpatwạkhọ sẹ, uyima. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Ma urunguttem, ọttọhk ugbikh-ẹ, ukwu ọbhạkh-ẹ, n'osose n'ose ikwanạng kw'uyim-ẹ k'mfhokpatwạkhọ.<verse eid="RUT 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Ọbạbh bẹ́, “Ọma anẹ wọ o?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:9">Rut ubhina bẹ́, “Amma Rut, ọtọhmnạng kwọ e. Wonga ẹvạramma s'ivạra sọ bubh-m, masẹ ode bẹ́, ọma wọ ade ọkkaan-ichimma.”<verse eid="RUT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Boaz ọbẹ́, “Nnwa kwaam, tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi udiọ-ọ. Ijibha nja ẹyọhng ch'acheden asi. Ọma adikkobh p'avaar-ọvaar ọttạra p'atto okpor, nákhubha. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Ma o, nnwa kwaam, tte nạng-ọ ojor. Fidede f'abạbh-m, m'nsi-usi nnạng-ọ, ukwuru bẹ́, ayok-ofhon paam phyibh asong ma bẹ́, ọma ade ikwanạng kw'ujibhi ẹmmaana. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />K'udik ọkka, amma nde uchinạng e, okhenka, ọkkaan-ichimma ọdwạkh-ọdwạk uning ka kw'ofor ọtạm ọyọhnga amma. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Yima maa, ma irungu. Ode iwu kk'echobha, de ocher bẹ́, obhekh-ọ, ọbaan ma. De nạn ifor núdia s'm'obhekh-ọ, k'oche kw'Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi urukhu akpen, amma m'mmekh-ọ obhek. Yima maa ttạrr iwu echobha.”<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Ma wọ Rut uyim k'mfhok-mfhok s'Boaz ttạrr iwu echobha, okhenka, ọpạm-ọpạm ubina k'ekpebha-rungu brasẹ ọnạng utin oyok. Boaz oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Tte ọnạng wạnọ-wạnọ nạngẹ osong bẹ́, ikwanạng ukwu uyima k'ibyi sabẹ n'ayuk abarli-mạma o.”<verse eid="RUT 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Ọbạra oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Tima ivạra nnọ s'abubh ma kwu, maama sẹ.” Masẹ kk'usia oche ngwọ, Boaz okpokhu abarli-mạma p'afu ọkhạrạbang ẹsajạnẹ, owon-ẹ ma ivạra, udira uyiẹ-ẹ, brasẹ ẹma oyeni n'ọkpa nnạm ọbhạna k'ofon.<verse eid="RUT 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Masẹ Rut ukpir k'ọchọhm, ọkka-ọmaan-udim ọbạbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Nnwa kwaam, aseng yạn?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:16">Ma wọ, Rut ọkpaakhẹ udik kw'idede kw'Boaz usi ọnang-ẹ. <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Ọbạra ọkpaakh-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọgba ọnang-m ọkhạrạbang ọsajạnẹ p'abarli-mạma, oben-m bẹ́ nạng mbọhk-mbọhk mfon nkebha ọkka-maan-udim kwaam.”<verse eid="RUT 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Ma wọ, Naomi oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Nnwa kwaam, ninga tik, ttạrr asonga oche kw'idik m'ide, ukwuru bẹ́, ujunung nwọ ọyọhng mókwokha ttạrr udik ngwa ọkhaam echo chemma.”<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s">Ọbada kw'Boaz ọttạra Rut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Ma wọ Boaz ubin ofona k'ẹbhama ọta uninga eyạr. Okpe kw'ọkkaan-ichimma kw'obeni kk'ukwa o, Boaz oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Aye, kwu ininga eyạr ka.” Ma wọ ọkkaan-ichimma nwọ ukwu uninga eyạr.<verse eid="RUT 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Boaz orengi adennạng p'ofhon ncho jobh, obẹ, “Aninga ẹyạr ma.” Abẹ aninga. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Ukwu oben ọkkaan-ichimma nwọ bẹ́, “Naomi kw'ubin k'Moab ukwuna, n'oben bẹ́ okpe isisek s'Ẹlimẹlẹk kw'ode nwotte kwamạna. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Ẹgwọ nkkẹ bẹ́, nsi-ọ asonga, ọfha adebh sẹ ma ititikha s'anạng mba p'aning eyạr ma, ọttạra k'ititikha s'adennạng p'anạng paam. De ọdaakh-ọ bẹ́ abhek sẹ, abhek. De nạnárora, tekh-m, ọfha nsonga. Ukwuru bẹ́, ọnạng ọdwạkh-ọdwạk kóde kw'ọkhaam efa bẹ́ ọbhek sẹ oyongu ọma, ọ́pọhn ka, n'ode amma.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:4">Ọkkaan-ichimma ọbhina bẹ́, “Amma m'mmek sẹ obhek.”<verse eid="RUT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Ma wọ Boaz obẹni bẹ́ “Ma iwu ch'm'adebh isisek nnọ k'mbọhk s'Naomi, ma agba adebh Rut kw'Moab kw'ode opokwa, ọfha osenga ma ọtera echo ch'ọnạng kwamạna kw'kk'upua, ọfha eche chẹ ọttạra ẹkhaama chẹ nạngẹ idimi.”<verse eid="RUT 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Ma wọ ọkkaan-ichimma nwọ obeni bẹ́, “De n'ode mạnna, amma dạk mạ́mmek, ọfha dạmadạma nạngẹ uning k'ẹkhaama chaam. Amma mạ́mmekh e.”<verse eid="RUT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Ma okpe ngwọ, wa ode ọmaanadik kw'anạng p'Israẹl bẹ́, brasẹ ọnạng obhek ẹkhaama ch'ọnạng ọdwạkh-ọdwạk, ọnạng wạnọ, ọbaan bẹ́ ọwạra ofhok gwạnọ kw'mkpafhok ọnạng ọnạng nwọ kw'm'obhek ọttọhk pfẹ.<verse eid="RUT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Ma wọ, ọkkaan-ichimma nwọ n'obeni Boaz bẹ́, “Ọma oyeni bhek isisek nnọ.” Ọwạra ọkpafhok gwạnọ kwẹ ọnạng Boaz.<verse eid="RUT 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Ma wọ Boaz ọkpaakhẹ adennạng p'ofhon ọttạra anạng phyibh bẹ́, “Chemma, abạnga made nttẹnsẹ bẹ́, amma kk'ẹkhaama ch'Ẹlimẹlẹk, ọttạra ch'Kiliyọn, ọttạra ch'Malọn mmekha bẹ́, phyibh k'Naomi k'mbọhk. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Kk'Rut kw'ubin Moab, kw'ode opokwa kw'Malọn, mbạra ntạkha masẹ ikwanạng kwaam, ọfha osenga ma otera eche ch'ọnạng kwamạna kw'kk'upua, ọttạra ẹkhaama chẹ, ọfha eche chẹ nạngẹ idimi k'ichimma chẹ, ọttạra k'ọnwẹr pf'ofhon. Chemma, abạnga ade nttẹnsẹ o!”<verse eid="RUT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Ma wọ adennạng mbọ ọttạra anạng phyibh p'aning k'ẹbhama aben-ẹ bẹ́, “Uwe e, amạna ande attẹnsẹ e. Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi ikwanạng nwọ kw'm'ọnwa kakhọ k'ọchọhm ode masẹ Rachẹl ọttạra Lea, p'akpạr mbọhk asi efonamma ch'Israẹl ẹbạr. Tte akhaama abạrada k'Ẹphrat, tte eche chọ ebạr k'Bẹtẹlẹhẹm. <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi osenga ma iva p'ikwanạng nwọ m'ọmaan, usi efonamma chọ ẹbạr ekhera ch'Pẹrẹz kw'uwa Tamar ọmaanẹ ọnạng Juda.”<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rut ọttạra Boaz atạk ayok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Ma wọ Boaz ọtạk Rut ode ikwanạng kwẹ. Masẹ uyim abẹ, Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi usi-ẹ utima ifhạr, ọmaan ujunung. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Ma wọ ipanạng abeni Naomi bẹ́, “Tte Ọvaar Ubinọkpaabyi ọtạkha ẹtọhnga, kw'kk'ọ ọkkaan-ichimma ọnạnga chemma! Tte nnwa nwọ uyin eche k'Israẹl ọbaabh-ọbaabha! <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Ẹma wọ m'ofhona akpen pọ, ọbạra okker-ọ k'atạm. Ọnyẹ kw'adaakhẹ idik, kw'ọbạra ujibh ọnạng-ọ ọyọhnga ajunungva asenọfa, kk'nnwa nwọ ọmaana.”<verse eid="RUT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Ma wọ Naomi ọtạk nnwa nwọ ọdọhkha k'ntaak, ọrạkh-ẹ. <verse eid="RUT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Ipanạng p'arukhu ma aben bẹ́, “Naomi kk'ujunungnwa ọkhaama e.” Abẹ akpẹ-ẹ Ọbẹd. Ọbẹd wa n'ukwu ode otte kw'Jẹsẹ. Jẹsẹ ode otte kw'Devid.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ab'otte p'Devid</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Maa wọ n'ode ẹnạmma ch'Pẹrẹz:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:18">wa Pẹrẹz ofhonu Hẹzrọn,<verse eid="RUT 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Hẹzrọn ofhon Ram,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:19">Ram ofon Aminadab,<verse eid="RUT 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Aminadab ofon Nashọn,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:20">Nashọn ofon Salmọn,<verse eid="RUT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Salmọn ofon Boaz,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:21">Boaz ofon Ọbẹd,<verse eid="RUT 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Ọbẹd ofon Jẹsẹ,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:22">Jẹsẹ n'ukwu ode otte kw'Devid.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>